@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+---
+id: dl-002-round-long-rental-discounts-to-whole-cents
+type: decision-log
+title: "Round long-rental discounts to whole cents"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Equipment prices and rental totals are integer euro cents. Applying a 10% reduction to a full-price
+rental total can produce a fractional cent.
+
+## Decision
+
+Rentals lasting three or more whole days receive a 10% reduction from their full price. Round the
+discounted total to the nearest whole euro cent before returning it from either `quote` or `book`.
+Rentals lasting one or two days retain their full price.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Quotes and confirmed bookings preserve their integer-cent `total` contract and display identical
+prices. A half-cent result rounds upward under JavaScript's `Math.round` behavior.
