+---
+id: task-003-apply-long-rental-discount
+type: task
+title: "Apply long-rental discount"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented a 10% discount for rentals lasting three or more whole days. Both `quote` and `book`
+now return the same discounted integer-cent total; fractional-cent results round to the nearest cent.
+Rentals shorter than three days retain their full price.
+
+Updated the rental-service documentation and added deterministic tests for the threshold, quote and
+booking totals, and fractional-cent rounding. `npm test` passes.
